mso-border-bottom-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;background:rgb(217,217,217);">
                    <p class=MsoNormal><b style="mso-bidi-font-weight:normal"><span style="font-family:仿宋;mso-bidi-font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;
font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><font face="仿宋">4.教学内容及进度安排</font></span></b><b
                                style="mso-bidi-font-weight:normal"><span style="font-family:仿宋;mso-ascii-font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-hansi-font-family:'Times New Roman';
mso-bidi-font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0000pt;
mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><font face="Times New Roman">/Course Content & Schedule</font></span></b><b
                                style="mso-bidi-font-weight:normal"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋;mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;
font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><o:p></o:p></span></b></p>
                    <p class=MsoNormal><span style="font-family:仿宋;mso-bidi-font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10.5000pt;
mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><font face="仿宋">（</font></span><span style="font-family:仿宋;mso-bidi-font-family:'Courier New';font-size:10.5000pt;
mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><font face="仿宋">按照教学周编排，应包含每节课教学内容及教学目标，如有作业及考核要求，请一并列明）</font></span><b
                                style="mso-bidi-font-weight:normal"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋;mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;
font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><o:p></o:p></span></b></p>
                </td>
            </tr>
            <tr style="height:176.7000pt;">
                <td width=777 valign=center colspan=14 style="width:466.7000pt;padding:0.0000pt 5.4000pt 0.0000pt 5.4000pt ;border-left:1.0000pt solid windowtext;
mso-border-left-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;border-right:1.0000pt solid windowtext;mso-border-right-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;
border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;border-bottom:1.0000pt solid windowtext;
mso-border-bottom-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;">
                    <p class=MsoNormal><span style="font-family:仿宋;mso-bidi-font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:12.0000pt;
mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><font face="仿宋"><p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><strong>绪论</strong><strong> & </strong><strong>第一章</strong><strong> </strong><strong>组织、细胞的适应和损伤</strong><strong> </strong>（3学时理论 + 1.5学时实验）</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><u>第</u><u>1</u><u>学时理论</u></span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">【<strong>教学目标</strong>】</span></p>
<ol>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">熟悉病理学的任务和专业特点，理解教学安排和学习方法；</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">理解并辨识细胞与组织适应的类型、病因、病理变化和后果；</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">理解并辨识细胞变性的类型、病理形态，理解其发生机制。</span></li>
</ol>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">【<strong>教学内容</strong>】</span></p>
<ol start="3">
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">介绍病理学的学科特点、任务、发展史和研究手段，</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">简介教学安排和学习方法，强调理论联系实践、基础联系临床、形态联系功能的学习方法；</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">细胞与组织适应包括萎缩、肥大、增生、化生的病因、分类、病理变化和后果；</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">细胞肿胀和脂肪变性的病因和病理形态。</span></li>
</ol>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">&nbsp; <strong>【思政教育】</strong></span></p>
<ol>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">介绍病理学从肉眼观察至应用先进技术的发展史，提出创新精神和科学思维；</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">简介我系的学科发展史和前辈病理学家，培养学科自豪感和爱国情怀。</span></li>
</ol>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><u>第</u><u>2</u><u>学时理论</u>：</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">【<strong>教学目标</strong>】</span></p>
<ol>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">理解并辨识坏死的基本病理形态；</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">理解并辨识坏死的病理类型和结局；</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">理解并能识别凋亡的病理形态，理解其发生机制。</span></li>
</ol>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">【<strong>教学内容</strong>】</span></p>
<ol>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">坏死的基本病理形态，包括细胞核、细胞质和间质的改变，注意坏死与死后自溶的鉴别；</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">各型坏死（凝固性坏死、液化性坏死、干酪样坏死、脂肪坏死、纤维蛋白样坏死、和坏疽）的病理学特点和坏死的结局；注意在同一器官组织因不同病因可导致不同的坏死类型；</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">凋亡的概念、病理变化和发生机制。</span></li>
</ol>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><strong>【思政教育】</strong></span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </strong>细胞受到损伤后，从适应性改变 → 可逆性改变（变性）→ 不可逆性改变 （坏死），体现了机体在损伤抗损伤中的对立统一，培养学生以自然辨证法学习病理学。</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><u>第</u><u>3</u><u>学时理论</u>：</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">【<strong>教学目标</strong>】</span></p>
<ol>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">理解自噬的发生机制，能识别其病理形态；</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">理解并辨识透明变性的概念、类型和病理形态；</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">理解粘液样变性、淀粉样变性、病理性钙化的概念，并能识别其病理形态；</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">理解细胞损伤的原因和机制。</span></li>
</ol>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">【<strong>教学内容</strong>】</span></p>
<ol>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">自噬的基本概念和病理形态；</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">透明变性的3种类型：细胞内、血管壁、结缔组织，不同的发病机制；</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">粘液样变性、淀粉样变性和病理性钙化的基本病理学形态和临床病理联系；</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">细胞损伤的原因（非生物因子、生物因子、必需物质的缺乏或过多、遗传和免疫反应异常）， 机制（缺氧性损伤、自由基性损伤等）。</span></li>
</ol>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><u>1.5</u><u>学时实验</u>：</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">【<strong>教学目标</strong>】</span></p>
<ol>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">理解并能识别细胞与组织适应、变性的常见类型及形态变化；</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">理解并辨识坏死的形态变化及后果。</span></li>
</ol>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">【<strong>教学内容</strong>】</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">重点大体标本：心脏褐色萎缩，脑萎缩，脂肪肝，脾/肾凝固性坏死，足干性坏疽；</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">重点切片： 心肌褐色萎缩和心肌肥大，肝细胞脂肪变性。</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">注意大体形态与镜下改变的联系、病理形态与临床表现之间的联系。</span></p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><strong>第二章</strong><strong>&nbsp; </strong><strong>血液循环障碍</strong> （3学时理论 + 1.5学时实验）</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><u>第</u><u>1</u><u>学时理论</u>：</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">【<strong>教学目标</strong>】</span></p>
<ol>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">理解动脉性充血的概念、发生机制，并能识别其病理形态；</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">理解并辨识淤血的原因、病理变化和后果，重要脏器的病理变化和临床病理联系；</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">理解并能识别缺血的病因、发病机制、病理形态和后果；</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">理解并辨识血栓的概念、类型、病理形态、转归和对机体的影响，理解血栓形成的条件及</span></li>
</ol>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">其机制。</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">【<strong>教学内容</strong>】</span></p>
<ol>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">动脉性充血和静脉性充血（淤血）的原因、病理变化和后果；</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">重要脏器淤血（肺、肝、脾）的病因、病理变化和后果；对比急性淤血和慢性淤血的不同；</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">理解并能识别缺血的病因、发病机制、病变及后果；</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">血栓的概念、类型、病理形态、转归和对机体的影响；其概念注意强调是活体心血管系统；导致血栓形成的魏尔啸三角里内皮细胞受损是根本因素；结合模式图理解血栓形成过程，注意机制结合形态；不同类型血栓的病理特点；血栓造成血管闭塞、栓塞、机化再通和钙化等的概念和临床意义。</span></li>
</ol>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><u>第</u><u>2</u><u>学时理论</u>：</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">【<strong>教学目标</strong>】</span></p>
<ol>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">理解DIC的概念、发生机制，并能识别其病理形态；</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">理解并辨识栓塞和栓子的概念、栓塞的类型和后果，理解栓子运行的途径。</span></li>
</ol>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">【<strong>教学内容</strong>】</span></p>
<ol>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">DIC概念、发生机制和病理形态；并非一种独立疾病；微循环内微血栓形成；早期高凝后期低凝的原因是大量凝血因子和纤维蛋白的消耗；</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">栓塞和栓子的概念；栓子随血流运行；不同类型的栓塞（血栓栓塞、脂肪栓塞、气体栓塞和羊水栓塞）的病因、病理形态和后果。</span></li>
</ol>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><u>第</u><u>3</u><u>学时理论</u>：</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">【<strong>教学目标</strong>】</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">理解并辨识梗死的概念、病因、类型、病理形态和转归；理解出血的分类、病因和后果。</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">【<strong>教学内容</strong>】</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">梗死和梗死形成的概念、病因、类型（贫血性梗死、出血性梗死和败血性梗死）、病理形态和转归。注意引导学生理解出血性梗死的发生条件。</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">【<strong>思政教育</strong>】</span></p>
<ol>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">肺淤血/肝淤血的形态特点及其与临床联系，强调形态与功能的有机联系；</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">血栓形成→脱落→阻塞血管→造成组织缺血性坏死（即梗死）的一系列动态病理改变，注意应用运动发展观看待这一系列病理改变。</span></li>
</ol>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><u>&nbsp;</u></span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><u>1.5</u><u>学时实验</u>：</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">【<strong>教学目标</strong>】</span></p>
<ol>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">理解并辨识淤血所致的一系列病理变化；</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">理解并辨识血栓的形态学特点，联系血栓形成的条件和过程，以及可能产生的后果；</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">理解并辨识栓塞和梗死的形态特点、发生发展和可能产生的后果；</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">理解血栓形成、栓塞和梗死的相互关系。</span></li>
</ol>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">【<strong>教学内容</strong>】</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">重点大体标本：肝淤血（槟榔肝），慢性肺淤血（肺褐色硬化），脑出血，混合血栓；</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">重点切片：慢性肺淤血，混合血栓，肾贫血性梗死</span></p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><strong>第三章</strong><strong>&nbsp; </strong><strong>炎症</strong><strong>&nbsp; </strong>（4学时理论 + 1学时实验）</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <u>第</u><u>1</u><u>学时理论</u>：</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">【<strong>教学目标</strong>】</span></p>
<ol>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">理解并辨识炎症的概念和意义；</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">理解急性炎症时局部的血管变化、炎性渗出和炎性浸润。</span></li>
</ol>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">【<strong>教学内容</strong>】</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">1．炎症的概念和意义：包括现代医学中炎症的概念、炎症的常见原因、生物学意义，提出感染和传染病的概念。</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">2、炎症的局部反应：急性炎症时局部的血管变化和渗出性改变</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">炎性充血：发生发展过程、机制；</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">炎性渗出：发生机制、渗出液的概念及意义；</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">炎性浸润：炎性浸润和炎细胞概念、炎细胞游出及吞噬的过程以及机制。</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><u>第</u><u>2</u><u>学时理论</u>：</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">【<strong>教学目标</strong>】</span></p>
<ol>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">理解炎性介质的常见类型及作用；</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">理解慢性炎症的病因，理解并辨识慢性炎症的组织学特征。</span></li>
</ol>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">【<strong>教学内容</strong>】</span></p>
<ol>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">炎性介质的常见类型及作用；</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">慢性炎症的病因，局部的增生性病变，特别是肉芽肿性病变的发生机制。</span></li>
</ol>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><u>第</u><u>3</u><u>学时理论</u>：</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">【<strong>教学目标</strong>】</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">理解并辨识不同炎症类型的概念、病理形态和结局。</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">【<strong>教学内容</strong>】</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">炎症的类型：渗出性炎包括浆液性炎、纤维蛋白性炎（假膜性炎）、化脓性炎（蜂窝织炎、脓肿和表面化脓，及相关的化脓、脓肿膜、窦道、瘘管、溃疡的概念）。</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><u>第</u><u>4</u><u>学时理论</u>：</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">【<strong>教学目标</strong>】</span></p>
<ol>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">理解并辨识增生性炎的病因、类型和病理形态；</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">理解其他类型炎的概念、病因，并能识别其组织形态学；</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">理解炎症的经过、结局和临床表现。</span></li>
</ol>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">【<strong>教学内容</strong>】</span></p>
<ol>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">增生性炎，包括肉芽肿性炎、炎性息肉和炎性假瘤；出血性炎、间质-血管周围炎、单核巨噬细胞系统增生性炎和纤维蛋白样坏死性炎等的基本特点。</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">炎症的经过和结局：愈复，迁延不愈变为慢性，蔓延扩散：局部蔓延，淋巴道扩散，血道扩散（菌血症、毒血症、败血症、脓毒血症）。</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">炎症的临床表现：</span></li>
</ol>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">局部表现：红、肿、热、痛和功能障碍；</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">全身反应：发热、外周血白细胞增多、单核巨噬细胞增生、实质细胞变性坏死。</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">【<strong>思政教育</strong>】</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">炎症反应的全过程是机体损伤与抗损伤的综合对抗过程，体现了矛盾对立统一的自然辨证法。</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><u>1</u><u>学时实验</u>：</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">【<strong>教学目标</strong>】</span></p>
<ol>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">理解并辨识急性炎症的基本病理变化；</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">理解并辨识各种炎症类型的形态特点；</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">理解炎症的发生、发展及结局。</span></li>
</ol>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">【<strong>教学内容</strong>】</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">重点大体标本: 纤维蛋白性心包炎（绒毛心），菌痢（假膜性肠炎），肺脓肿；</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">重点切片：肺肉芽肿性炎（肺粟粒性结核）</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 注意识别不同类型的炎症细胞。</span></p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><strong>第四章</strong><strong>&nbsp; </strong><strong>修复</strong><strong>&nbsp; </strong>（1学时理论 + 0.5学时实验）</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><strong>【教学目标】</strong></span></p>
<ol start="8">
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">理解细胞再生的能力、细胞生长的调节机制；</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">了解细胞外基质的概念、类型、基本生理功能和调控机制；</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">理解并辨识肉芽组织的概念、组织学形态和意义，以及结缔组织修复过程；</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">理解创伤愈合的类型，并能识别其病理特点。</span></li>
</ol>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">【<strong>教学内容</strong>】</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">1．修复、再生的概念；</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">2．细胞生长及其调节：细胞的再生能力，细胞生长周期及其调节机制，细胞生长的调节，常见的生长因子；</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">3．细胞外基质（ECM）沉积：ECM概念和常见类型，ECM的合成、修饰、分泌</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">ECM的降解（MMP、纤溶酶/PAs/PAIs系统, TIMP）</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">ECM的调节（细胞因子、整合素、ECM降解产物）</span></p>
<ol start="4">
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">结缔组织修复：肉芽组织的概念</span></li>
</ol>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 新血管形成、成纤维细胞增生和移行、ECM沉积、组织重建；</span></p>
<ol start="5">
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">创伤愈合：概念，一期愈合，二期愈合；</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">影响修复的因素：</span></li>
</ol>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">全身因素：营养、白细胞、内分泌激素；</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">局部因素：感染、机械性因素、异物、创伤的组织类型和血供。</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">【<strong>思政教育</strong>】</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">应用运动发展观，理解和理解并辨识从组织损伤→肉芽组织→最终演变为瘢痕的修复的过程。</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><u>1</u><u>学时实验</u></span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">【<strong>教学目标</strong>】</span></p>
<ol>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">理解并辨识肉芽组织的形态特征、发生发展及其在创伤愈合中的作用；</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">理解并辨识一期愈合与二期愈合的病理特点与区别。</span></li>
</ol>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">【<strong>教学内容</strong>】</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">重点大体标本：皮肤一期愈合；重点切片：肉芽组织。</span></p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><strong>第五章</strong><strong>&nbsp; </strong><strong>肿瘤</strong><strong> </strong>&nbsp;（4学时理论 + 1.5学时实验）</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><u>第</u><u>1</u><u>学时理论</u><strong>：</strong></span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><strong>【教学目标】</strong></span></p>
<ol>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">理解并辨识肿瘤的概念，良恶性肿瘤的鉴别；</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">理解并辨识肿瘤的基本形态和结构特点；</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">理解肿瘤的分类和命名原则，理解癌和肉瘤的鉴别诊断；</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">理解肿瘤的分期和分级；</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">理解肿瘤的基本生物学特性。</span></li>
</ol>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">【<strong>教学内容</strong>】</span></p>
<ol>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">肿瘤的概念：概念；间变的含义；自律性、遗传性、异质性的基本概念；</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">肿瘤的良恶性：鉴别：分化、生长方式、生长速度、核分裂像、播散、后果；</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">肿瘤的基本病变：包括外形、颜色、大小、数目，肿瘤的组织结构；</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">肿瘤的分类、命名原则：良恶性肿瘤命名的差别，强调癌、肉瘤的定义和不同；</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">肿瘤的分级和分期：分级是指肿瘤的分化程度，分期是指肿瘤波及的范围和播散；</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">肿瘤的基本生物学特性：包括肿瘤的形态特征、生理特征、生化代谢、免疫特征。其中以肿瘤的形态特征为重点。</span></li>
</ol>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">.&nbsp;&nbsp; 【<strong>思政教育</strong>】</span></p>
<ol>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">应用归纳总结法学习良恶性肿瘤的鉴别诊断；</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">组织起源是鉴别癌与肉瘤的根本，抓住问题本质的学习方法。</span></li>
</ol>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><u>第</u><u>2</u><u>学时理论</u>：</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">【<strong>教学目标</strong>】</span></p>
<ol>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">理解并辨识肿瘤的播散，强调癌和肉瘤的转移途径的差异性；</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">理解并辨识癌前病变的概念、常见病变和意义，理解并辨识原位癌的概念；</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">理解常用的肿瘤的病理诊断方法的应用范围；</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">了解肿瘤的流行病学和人群易感性；</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">了解肿瘤的病因、肿瘤与宿主的关系。</span></li>
</ol>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">【<strong>教学内容</strong>】</span></p>
<ol>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">肿瘤的播散：侵袭，浸润，转移（淋巴道、血道、种植性转移）；</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">各种癌前病变、癌前病变与癌的关系；</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">肿瘤的病理诊断：病理诊断中切除活检、吸取活检、冷冻重点切片在病理诊断中的不同作用和应用范围；</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">全世界和中国的肿瘤发生率，环境与肿瘤、年龄与肿瘤、遗传与肿瘤的关系；</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">肿瘤的化学致癌剂，重点介绍生物致癌因素和前沿的生物致癌分子机制；</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">物理制癌因素；</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">肿瘤与宿主的关系：恶病质，肿瘤伴随综合征，功能性肿瘤。</span></li>
</ol>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">【<strong>思政教育</strong>】</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">医学前辈在身患恶性肿瘤的情况下发挥余热，体现崇高的敬业精神。</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><u>第</u><u>3</u><u>学时理论</u><strong>：</strong></span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">【<strong>教学目标</strong>】</span></p>
<ol>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">理解原癌基因、癌基因和抑癌基因的概念；</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">理解凋亡调节基因的概念；</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">理解上述基因在肿瘤发生中的作用机制；</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">理解肿瘤永生化的分子机制。</span></li>
</ol>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">【<strong>教学内容</strong>】</span></p>
<ol>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">简单复习细胞生长周期及其调控；</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">原癌基因分类，激活的方式，抑癌基因的分类及失活；</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">凋亡调节基因在细胞恶变过程中的作用；</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">肿瘤永生化的分子机制：端粒酶。</span></li>
</ol>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><u>第</u><u>4</u><u>学时理论</u>：</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">【<strong>教学目标</strong>】</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">理解并能辨识常见肿瘤的良恶性及各种常见肿瘤的特征。</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">&nbsp;&nbsp; 【<strong>教学内容</strong>】</span></p>
<ol>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">上皮来源肿瘤：鳞状上皮来源，腺上皮来源；再次强调良恶性的鉴别诊断；</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">非淋巴造血间叶组织常见肿瘤：纤维组织，脂肪组织，软骨和骨，脉管组织；</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">淋巴造血系统常见肿瘤：淋巴瘤，白血病；</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">神经系统常见肿瘤：强调中枢神经系统肿瘤的特殊部位；</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">其他常见肿瘤：黑痣和黑色素瘤；混合瘤，畸胎瘤，等。</span></li>
</ol>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><u>1.5</u><u>学时实验</u></span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">【<strong>教学目标</strong>】</span></p>
<ol>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">良恶性肿瘤的鉴别，试从肿瘤的细胞与组织分化、生长方式、生长速度、有无转移以及对机体的危害等各个方面加以比较；</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">理解并能识别癌和肉瘤在形态上的区别；</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">理解并能识别常见上皮及间叶肿瘤。</span></li>
</ol>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">【<strong>教学内容</strong>】</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">重点大体标本: 皮肤乳头状瘤，皮肤鳞形细胞癌，结肠腺瘤，肠（或胃）腺癌，腋窝淋巴结转移性乳腺癌，肺转移性癌；</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">重点切片：食管鳞形细胞癌，结肠腺瘤，结肠腺癌。</span></p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><strong>第六章</strong><strong>&nbsp; </strong><strong>心血管系统疾病</strong><strong>&nbsp; </strong>（3学时理论 + 1.5学时实验）</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><u>第</u><u>1</u><u>学时理论</u></span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">【<strong>教学目标</strong>】</span></p>
<ol>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">重点理解并辨识动脉粥样硬化的基本病理变化，理解其概念、病因、发病机制；</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">重点理解并辨识冠心病，尤其透壁性心肌梗死的病理变化及临床联系。</span></li>
</ol>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">【<strong>教学内容</strong>】</span></p>
<ol>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">动脉粥样硬化的病因：高脂血症，高血压，吸烟，糖尿病，年龄与性别，遗传因素，等；</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">发病机制：内膜受损，血脂沉积及氧化修饰，单核巨噬细胞和平滑肌细胞反应；</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">基本病变：早期—脂斑或脂纹，进展—纤维斑块，粥样斑块；</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">粥样斑块的复合性病变：溃疡，出血，血栓形成，钙化，动脉瘤，主动脉夹层；</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">重要器官的动脉粥样硬化：主动脉，颈动脉及脑动脉，肾动脉，四肢动脉；</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">冠心病的概念及基本病变；</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">类型：心绞痛，心肌梗死，慢性冠心病，冠状动脉性猝死，</span></li>
</ol>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 重点理解并辨识透壁性心肌梗死的病理变化和并发症，及其临床病理联系。</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">【<strong>思政教育</strong>】</span></p>
<ol>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">从本节开始进入各论学习，强调联系总论内容，以“冠状动脉粥样硬化伴血栓形成”导致“心肌梗死”为例，让学生自行推论病理特征，提升学生自主学习的自信心，培养融会贯通的学习方法；</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">结合最新文献，有关HDL与心血管死亡率呈U型相关（科研进展），培养科学思维和科研兴趣，科研反哺教学。</span></li>
</ol>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><u>第</u><u>2</u><u>学时理论</u></span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">【<strong>教学目标</strong>】</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">1.理解且能辨识高血压的基础病理变化，以及重要器官的病理改变；</span></p>
<ol start="2">
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">了解解高血压病的概念、病因和发病机制。</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">重点理解并辨识风湿病的基本病理变化，风湿性心脏病的病变及临床病理联系；</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">理解风湿病的概念、病因及发病机理，心脏外的风湿病变（关节、皮肤和脑）。</span></li>
</ol>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">【<strong>教学内容</strong>】</span></p>
<ol>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">高血压病的概念、病因和发病机制、类型（原发性，继发性）和基本病理特点；</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">重要脏器的病理特点及临床病理联系：心脏，肾脏，脑，视网膜，等；</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">恶性高血压的病因、病理特点及临床病理联系；</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">风湿病的病因和发病机制：自身免疫性疾病；</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">风湿病的基本病理变化：坏死渗出期，增生期或肉芽肿期，瘢痕期或愈合期；</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">风湿性心脏病：全心炎；疣状赘生物，风湿小体，绒毛心；</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">风湿病的其他脏器病变：关节炎，皮肤病变，风湿性动脉炎，风湿性脑病。</span></li>
</ol>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><u>第</u><u>3</u><u>学时理论</u></span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">【<strong>教学目标</strong>】</span></p>
<ol>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">理解并能识别亚急性/急性细菌性心内膜炎的病因、病变特点、病理临床联系和转归；</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">理解心瓣膜病的血流动力学变化、心脏病变、临床病理联系和结局；</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">能识别病毒性心肌炎的病理形态，理解其病因、临床病理联系和结局；</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">理解心肌病的概念和类型。</span></li>
</ol>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">【<strong>教学内容</strong>】</span></p>
<ol>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">感染性心内膜炎的概念；细菌性心内膜炎：急性，亚急性；</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">亚急性细菌性心内膜炎：</span></li>
</ol>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">病因和发病机制；病理变化：（1）心脏病变；（2）心外器官病变；</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;与急性细菌性心内膜炎的不同；</span></p>
<ol start="3">
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">心瓣膜病：概念，瓣膜狭窄，瓣膜关闭不全</span></li>
</ol>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 二尖瓣病变：二尖瓣狭窄，二尖瓣关闭不全；</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 主动脉瓣病变：主动脉瓣狭窄，主动脉瓣关闭不全；</span></p>
<ol start="4">
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">病毒性心肌炎：弥漫性淋巴细胞浸润；</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">心肌病：扩张性，肥厚性，限制性。</span></li>
</ol>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><u>1.5</u><u>学时实验</u></span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">【<strong>教学目标</strong>】</span></p>
<ol>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">理解并辨识风湿性心脏病的基本病理变化、发生发展及其后果；</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">理解并能识别亚急性和急性细菌性心内膜炎的形态特点；</span></li>
</ol>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">比较风湿性心内膜炎与细菌性心内膜炎形态上的区别及相互关系；</span></p>
<ol start="3">
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">理解并辨识高血压病的主要脏器的病理改变、后果及其与动脉粥样硬化的关系；</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">理解并辨识动脉粥样硬化的病变特点，及其在不同脏器所引起的各种后果。</span></li>
</ol>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">【<strong>教学内容</strong>】</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">重点大体标本：主动脉粥样硬化，慢性风湿性心脏病（二尖瓣病变），亚急性细菌性心内膜炎，高血压性心脏病；</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">重点切片：主动脉粥样硬化，亚急性细菌性心内膜炎，急性心肌梗死。</span></p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><strong>第七章</strong><strong>&nbsp; </strong><strong>呼吸系统疾病</strong><strong> </strong><strong>&nbsp;</strong>（6学时理论 + 1.5学时实验）</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><u>第</u><u>1</u><u>学时理论</u></span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><strong>【教学目标】</strong></span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">理解大叶性肺炎和小叶性肺炎的病因及诱因、临床病理联系和转归，并辨识病理形态特点。</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><strong>【教学内容】</strong></span></p>
<ol>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">大叶性肺炎：概念，病因及诱因，</span></li>
</ol>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 病理变化：充血水肿期，红色肝变期，灰色肝变期，溶解消散期，</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 临床病理联系及结局，</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;并发症：肺肉质化，脓肿/脓胸，败血症、中毒性休克；</span></p>
<ol start="2">
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">小叶性肺炎：概念，病因的多样性，发病机制（机体的情况），</span></li>
</ol>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">形态特征及结局(青壮年军团病)；</span></p>
<ol start="3">
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">上述两种肺炎的鉴别诊断。</span></li>
</ol>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><u>第</u><u>2</u><u>学时理论</u></span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><strong>【教学目标】</strong></span></p>
<ol>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">熟悉间质性肺炎的病因、发病机制、病理改变、临床病理联系和转归；</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">熟悉成人呼吸窘迫综合征的发病机制、病理变化和转归。</span></li>
</ol>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><strong>【教学内容】</strong></span></p>
<ol>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">间质性肺炎：概念，病因，病理变化，结局；</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><strong> </strong>ARDS：概念，发病机理，病理变化(急性期，透明膜)。</span></li>
</ol>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><u>第</u><u>3</u><u>学时理论</u></span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">【<strong>教学目标</strong>】</span></p>
<ol>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">理解慢性阻塞性肺部疾病（COPD）和小气道的概念；</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">理解慢性支气管炎的概念和临床病理联系，能辨识病理变化，熟悉其病因和发病机制；</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">理解并辨识肺气肿的概念、类型、病理变化和临床病理联系，熟悉其发病机制。</span></li>
</ol>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">【<strong>教学内容</strong>】</span></p>
<ol>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">COPD和小气道概述；</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">慢性支气管炎：概念；病因：理化因子、感染和防御机能受损；</span></li>
</ol>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;病理变化：炎症、腺体增生、支气管上皮及软骨破坏；</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;临床病理联系；</span></p>
<ol start="3">
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">肺气肿：概念，病理变化及分型，临床病理联系和后果。</span></li>
</ol>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><u>第</u><u>4</u><u>学时理论</u></span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">【<strong>教学目标</strong>】</span></p>
<ol>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">理解并辨识支气管扩张症的病因、发病机制、病理变化，临床病理联系及转归；</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">理解并能识别哮喘和肺不张的病因、发病机制、病理变化和临床表现。</span></li>
</ol>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">【<strong>教学内容</strong>】</span></p>
<ol>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">肺不张：概念，发病机理，病理形态，临床病理联系，转归；</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">支扩症：概念，病因和发病、病理变化，临床病理联系。</span></li>
</ol>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><u>第</u><u>5</u><u>学时理论</u></span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">【<strong>教学目标</strong>】</span></p>
<ol>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">理解并辨识硅肺的病因和发病机制、病理变化、分期、临床病理联系和并发症；</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">理解并辨识肺源性心脏病的病因和发病机制、病理变化、临床病理联系和转归。</span></li>
</ol>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">【<strong>教学内容</strong>】</span></p>
<ol>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">矽肺<strong>：</strong>概念(尘肺)；病因： SiO<sub>2</sub>的浓度，颗粒大小及矽肺的命运；</span></li>
</ol>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">发病机理：化学毒性，免疫机理；基本病变：矽结节，弥漫性肺纤维化；</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">临床病理分期；后果及并发症: 进行性肺功能减退，肺结核，肺心病，自发性气胸；</span></p>
<ol start="2">
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">肺心病: 病因和发病机理，病理变化，临床病理联系，转归。</span></li>
</ol>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><u>第</u><u>6</u><u>学时理论</u></span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">【<strong>教学目标</strong>】</span></p>
<ol>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">理解并辨识肺癌的类型、病理变化、临床病理联系、扩散和转移，熟悉其病因和发病机制；</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">理解并能识别鼻咽癌的病因、发病机制、病理变化、临床病理联系、浸润和转移。</span></li>
</ol>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">【<strong>教学内容</strong>】</span></p>
<ol>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">肺癌：发病因素：吸烟，大气污染，工业致癌物，家庭污染，慢性炎症；组织发生；</span></li>
</ol>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp; 大体：中央型，周边型，多结节型，弥漫型</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">镜检：鳞癌，腺癌，大细胞癌，小细胞癌&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">播散：蔓延(肺，胸膜，纵膈，心包，食管)；转移：淋巴道；血道(脑，肾，肾上腺，骨)；</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">并发症：肺不张，肺气肿，反复感染，支气管扩张，气管食管瘘；</span></p>
<ol start="2">
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">鼻咽癌：发病因素 — 遗传，环境，EB病毒感染等；病理形态。</span></li>
</ol>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><u>1.5</u><u>学时实验</u></span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">【<strong>教学目标</strong>】</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">&nbsp;1.理解并辨识大叶性肺炎、小叶性肺炎、慢性支气管炎、肺气肿、支气管扩张症、矽肺、肺癌、鼻咽癌等常见疾病的病理形态变化；</span></p>
<ol start="2">
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">综合上述疾病的重点大体标本及组织重点切片所见，进一步理解这些疾病的发展机制、相互联系及由此引起的临床表现。</span></li>
</ol>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">【<strong>教学内容</strong>】</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">重点大体标本：大叶性肺炎，小叶性肺炎，肺气肿，支气管扩张，肺癌；</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">重点切片：大叶性肺炎，小叶性肺炎。</span></p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><strong>第八章</strong><strong> </strong><strong>消化系统疾病</strong><strong>&nbsp; </strong>（6学时理论 + 3学时实验）</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><strong>&nbsp;</strong><u>第</u><u>1</u><u>学时理论</u></span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">【<strong>教学目标</strong>】</span></p>
<ol>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">理解并辨识慢性胃炎的病理变化，熟悉慢性胃炎的病因及其与胃癌、胃溃疡的关系；</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">理解并辨识消化性溃疡的病理变化及并发症，熟悉消化溃疡的病因及发病机制；</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">理解并辨识食管癌、胃癌及大肠癌的共同病理特点；</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">了解食管癌、胃癌及大肠癌的病因和发病机制。</span></li>
</ol>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">【<strong>教学内容</strong>】</span></p>
<ol>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">消化系统的解剖与生理，消化系统疾病与其它系统疾病的关系；</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">胃炎的概念，简述急性胃炎的病变及病因、与慢性胃炎的不同；</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">慢性胃炎的概念、病变特点、病因与发病机制，重点介绍幽门螺杆菌及其致病机制；</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">消化性溃疡的概念、病因与发病机制、病理变化、并发症及临床病理联系；</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">食管癌、胃癌及大肠癌的共同病理特点应包括：</span></li>
</ol>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">①发病年龄和性别；②发病有一定的地理分布差异；③有一定的好发部位；</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">④中、晚期在大体形态上均可分为：蕈伞型或息肉型、溃疡型、弥漫浸润型，大肠癌还可有胶样型；</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">⑤早期癌；⑥组织学形态：食管癌绝大多数为鳞状细胞癌，胃癌和大肠癌以腺癌为主，可见粘液腺癌及印戒细胞癌；</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">⑦浸润与转移：淋巴道转移—Virchow淋巴结，种植转移——腹膜癌，胃癌尤其是胃粘液腺癌种植转移—Krukenberg 瘤，血道转移常至肝和肺；</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">⑧癌前病变：不典型增生；大肠癌的癌前期病变—家族性腺瘤性息肉病（FAP）、绒毛乳头状腺瘤、慢性溃疡性结肠炎、肠血吸虫病伴溃疡边缘上皮过度增生；</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">⑨发生机理与基因改变：食管癌—抑癌基因p53、p16突变；胃癌—细胞生长因子受体基因；大肠癌基因—APC、DCC、p53、K-ras基因突变，DNA修复酶与DNA低甲基化；</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">⑩癌肿引起的合并症：有梗阻、出血、穿孔等。</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">【<strong>思政教育</strong>】</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">HP发现者的奉献精神，致敬医学家的奉献精神、投身医学事业。</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><u>第</u><u>2</u><u>学时理论</u></span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">【<strong>教学目标</strong>】</span></p>
<ol>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">了解嗜肝病毒的形态、结构、抗原、传播途径、临床病程；</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">理解并辨识病毒性肝炎的基本病变，急性肝炎、慢性肝炎（含慢性带毒状态）的病变特点；</span></li>
</ol>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">【<strong>教学内容</strong>】</span></p>
<ol>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">病毒性肝炎的概念及病因学，介绍五种嗜肝病毒；</span></li>
</ol>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">2．病毒性肝炎的基本病变：①肝细胞病变：变性，凋亡，坏死。依坏死范围及分布可分为点状坏死、灶性坏死、界面性肝炎、碎片状坏死<strong>、</strong>桥接坏死、亚大块坏死和大块坏死。②炎症反应；③增生：包括肝细胞再生、胆管上皮细胞增生和枯否细胞增生，肝星状细胞增生，成纤维细胞增生，纤维间隔；</span></p>
<ol start="3">
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">临床病理分型：急性肝炎、慢性肝炎、重症肝炎；</span></li>
</ol>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">（1）急性肝炎：弥漫性肝细胞水样变性，气球样变，可见嗜酸小体、点/灶状坏死、桥接坏死，淤胆和再生（恢复期）；炎症反应明显；</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">（2）慢性肝炎：轻度慢性肝炎，重度慢性肝炎，慢性带毒状态。</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">第3学时理论</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">【<strong>教学目标</strong>】</span></p>
<ol>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">理解并辨识重症肝炎的类型、病理变化和临床病理联系；</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">理解并辨识肝硬化（结节性肝硬化）的概念、形态学分类、病理变化、病因及发病机制；</span></li>
</ol>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">【<strong>教学内容</strong>】</span></p>
<ol>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">急性重型肝炎：肝细胞广泛、迅速坏死；</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">亚急性重型肝炎：亚大块坏死，同时出现肝细胞再生；</span></li>
</ol>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">注意与急性重型肝炎的病理变化的差别。</span></p>
<ol start="3">
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">慢性重型肝炎：</span></li>
</ol>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">4．病毒性肝炎的发病机制：乙型肝炎病变的发生及病变轻重与人体的免疫机制有关。</span></p>
<ol start="5">
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">肝硬化的概念和形态学分类，与肝纤维化的关系，病因：病毒性肝炎及酒精性肝炎；</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">肝硬化的发病机制：三个环节，即肝细胞损伤的机制、弥漫性纤维化和肝细胞再生；</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">肝硬化的病理变化：假小叶。</span></li>
</ol>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">第4学时理论</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">【<strong>教学目标</strong>】</span></p>
<ol>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">理解并辨识肝硬化的临床症状及其病理学基础；</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">理解并辨识肝细胞癌的病理形态及临床病理联系。</span></li>
</ol>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">【<strong>教学内容</strong>】</span></p>
<ol>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">肝硬化的临床症候群：门脉高压、肝功能不全以及其病理基础；</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">肝细胞癌的病因、发病机制、病理形态及临床表现；</span></li>
</ol>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">【<strong>思政教育</strong>】</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">介绍我校附属医院在肝癌研究方面的显著成绩，以科研反哺教学，培养科研兴趣。</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><u>第</u><u>5</u><u>学时理论</u></span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">【<strong>教学目标</strong>】</span></p>
<ol>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">了解伤寒的传播途径和发病机理，理解并辨识肠伤寒的病理变化和临床病理联系；</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">熟悉菌痢的病因、传染途径和发病机制，理解并辨识其病理变化及临床病理联系。</span></li>
</ol>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">【<strong>教学内容</strong>】</span></p>
<ol>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">伤寒：病因（伤寒沙门菌），传播途径（粪口传播），发病机制等，</span></li>
</ol>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">伤寒的基本病理变化（伤寒细胞、伤寒肉芽肿）；</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">伤寒肠道病变：四期（髓样肿胀期、坏死期、溃疡期、愈合期）的病理改变及临床病理联系；</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;描述伤寒的临床病理联系、及并发症（肠出血、肠穿孔）；</span></p>
<ol start="2">
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">菌痢：病因（痢疾杆菌），传染途径（粪口），发病机理；</span></li>
</ol>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">病理变化（纤维蛋白性炎），临床病理联系；慢性菌痢的病理变化及临床病理联系；</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">中毒性菌痢肠道病理变化（滤泡性肠炎）。</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><u>第</u><u>6</u><u>学时理论</u></span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">【<strong>教学目标</strong>】</span></p>
<ol>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">理解阿米巴病发病机理，能辨识肠阿米巴病和肝阿米巴病的部位和病变特点；</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">了解血吸虫病的发病机制，理解并辨识血吸虫虫卵引起的基本病变，理解并辨识肠血吸虫病的病理变化及临床病理联系。</span></li>
</ol>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">【<strong>教学内容</strong>】</span></p>
<ol>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">阿米巴病: 病因（溶组织内阿米巴），传播途径（粪口）；</span></li>
</ol>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">阿米巴生活史：感染型病原体（阿米巴包囊），致病型病原体（阿米巴滋养体）；</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">阿米巴的发病机制：液化性坏死；</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">肠阿米巴病的病理变化及临床病理联系：</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">急性期特征性病变（烧瓶样溃疡）及阿米巴滋养体形态特点，</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">慢性肠阿米巴病病理变化（阿米巴瘤）；</span></p>
<ol start="2">
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">血吸虫病的病因和感染途径，血吸虫的生活史和体内过程；</span></li>
</ol>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">发病机制（主要是虫卵可溶性抗原SEA导致的IV型变态反应）；</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">血吸虫病的病理变化：尾蚴性皮炎、童虫和成虫引起的病变（血管炎及过敏反应），</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">虫卵引起的虫卵结节（嗜酸性脓肿→假结核结节→纤维钙化结节）；</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">肠血吸虫病：部位，病理过程（急性虫卵结节→浅表溃疡→肠壁纤维化），临床病理联系。</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><u>3</u><u>学时实验</u>：</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">【<strong>教学目标</strong>】1. 理解并辨识胃与十二指肠溃疡的病理变化、后果、并发症；</span></p>
<ol start="2">
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">理解并能识别消化道肿瘤病理形态的共同特点和临床病理联系；</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">理解并辨识各型病毒性肝炎的病理变化特点和临床病理学联系；</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">理解并辨识各种肝硬化的发生、发展、病变特点及其后果；</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">理解并能识别原发性肝癌与肝炎、肝硬化的关系及其病理形态特点；</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">掌握菌痢、肠伤寒、肠阿米巴病、血吸虫病的主要病理变化及其并发症。</span></li>
</ol>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">【<strong>教学内容】</strong></span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">重点大体标本：胃溃疡，胃癌/食管癌/结肠癌，亚急性重型肝炎，结节性肝硬化，原发性肝细胞性肝癌，肠伤寒，细菌性痢疾，结肠阿米巴，肠血吸虫病；</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">重点切片：胃溃疡，结节性肝硬化，肠伤寒，细菌性痢疾，结肠阿米巴，慢性肠血吸虫病。</span></p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><strong>第九章</strong><strong>&nbsp; </strong><strong>泌尿系统疾病</strong><strong> </strong><strong>&nbsp;</strong>（3学时理论 + 1学时实验）</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">&nbsp;<u>第</u><u>1</u><u>学时理论</u></span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">【<strong>教学目标</strong>】理解肾小球肾炎的发病机制、基本病理变化及临床病理联系。</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">【<strong>教学内容</strong>】</span></p>
<ol>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">泌尿系统组织形态学和功能简介；</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">肾小球肾炎（GN）的发病机制：循环免疫复合物型肾炎，原位免疫复合物型肾炎；</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">GN基本病理变化：细胞增生，基膜增厚，坏死和炎症渗出，硬化和纤维化；</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">GN临床表现：肾炎综合征， 肾病综合征，急性肾损伤（快速进行性肾小球肾炎），等。</span></li>
</ol>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">&nbsp; <u>第</u><u>2</u><u>学时理论</u></span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">【<strong>教学目标</strong>】</span></p>
<ol>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">理解并辨识表现为肾病综合征和肾炎综合征的常见肾小球肾炎的病理变化、临床病理联系和结局，熟悉其病因和发病机制；</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">理解并辨识表现为肾炎综合征的GN的病因和发病机制、病理特点、临床病理联系及转归。</span></li>
</ol>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">【<strong>教学内容</strong>】</span></p>
<ol>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">表现为肾病综合征的常见类型GN的病理变化、临床病理联系和结局，熟悉其病因和发病机制，包括微小病变病、局灶节段性肾小球硬化、膜性肾病、膜增生性肾小球肾炎；</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">表现为肾炎综合征的常见类型GN：急性弥漫增生性肾小球肾炎，IgA肾病，重点理解并辨识其病理变化和临床病理联系。</span></li>
</ol>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">【<strong>思政教育</strong>】</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">结合微小病变的发病机制的最新科研进展，培养科研兴趣，学习病理学家的敬业精神。</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><u>第</u><u>3</u><u>学时理论</u></span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">【<strong>教学目标</strong>】&nbsp;</span></p>
<ol>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">理解并辨识快速进行性肾小球肾炎的病因和发病机制、病理特点、临床病理联系和转归；</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">理解并辨识慢性硬化性肾炎的病因和发病机制、病理特点、临床病理联系及转归；</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">理解肾盂肾炎的病因和发病机制，理解并辨识急/慢性肾盂肾炎的病理变化、临床病理联系</span></li>
</ol>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">及转归；</span></p>
<ol start="4">
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">熟悉泌尿系统肿瘤的病变特点。</span></li>
</ol>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">【<strong>教学内容</strong>】</span></p>
<ol>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">快速进行性肾小球肾炎：新月体性肾炎的病因、分型、病理变化、临床病理联系和结局；</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">慢性硬化性肾炎：病因、病理变化、临床病理联系及其结局；</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">肾盂肾炎的概念，病因：感染途径（血源性感染，下行性感染），诱发因素；</span></li>
</ol>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">&nbsp;急性肾盂肾炎的病理特点、临床病理联系及结局；</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">慢性肾盂肾炎的病理特点、临床病理联系及结局；</span></p>
<ol start="4">
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">肾细胞癌、肾母细胞瘤和尿路上皮肿瘤的病变特点。</span></li>
</ol>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><u>1</u><u>学时实验</u></span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">【<strong>教学目标</strong>】1. 理解并辨识各型GN的病理形态特点及其对机体的影响；</span></p>
<ol start="2">
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">理解并能识别肾盂肾炎的病理变化特点及其对机体的影响。</span></li>
</ol>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">【<strong>教学内容</strong>】</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">重点大体标本：慢性硬化性肾小球肾炎，急性肾盂肾炎；</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">重点切片：急性肾小球肾炎，急性肾盂肾炎。</span></p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><strong>第十章 </strong><strong>神经系统疾病</strong><strong> </strong><strong>（</strong><strong>3</strong><strong>学时理论</strong><strong> + 1</strong><strong>学时实验）</strong></span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><u>第</u><u>1</u><u>学时理论</u></span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">【<strong>教学目标</strong>】</span></p>
<ol>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">理解并辨识中枢神经系统常见并发症，脑血液循环障碍及血管病变；</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">熟悉中枢神经系统主要细胞的基本病变，常见神经系统肿瘤的特点；</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">熟悉传染病的共同特点。</span></li>
</ol>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">【<strong>教学内容</strong>】1. 中枢神经系统疾病概述，主要细胞基本病变，常见并发症；</span></p>
<ol start="2">
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">脑循环障碍及血管病变；</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">常见神经系统肿瘤；</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">传染病的共同特征，神经系统感染性疾病特点。</span></li>
</ol>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><u>第</u><u>2</u><u>学时理论</u></span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">【<strong>教学目标</strong>】</span></p>
<ol>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">理解并能识别中枢神经系统疾病概述，脊髓灰质炎病变特点，海绵状脑病病变特点；</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">理解并辨识流行性脑脊髓膜炎的病变特点、病理变化、临床病理联系及结局（沃-弗综合征）。</span></li>
</ol>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">【<strong>教学内容</strong>】</span></p>
<ol>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">脊髓灰质炎；2. 海绵状脑病；3. 流行性脑脊髓膜炎。</span></li>
</ol>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><u>第</u><u>3</u><u>学时理论</u></span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">【<strong>教学目标</strong>】</span></p>
<ol>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">理解并辨识流行性乙型脑炎传播途径、病理变化、临床病理联系及结局；</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">熟悉阿尔茨海默病和Parkinson病的病理特点、发病机制和临床表现。</span></li>
</ol>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">【<strong>教学内容</strong>】 1. 乙型脑炎，注意其与流行性脑脊髓膜炎的比较；</span></p>
<ol start="2">
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">脑变性疾病概述；</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">Alzheimer病、Parkinson病的病变特点；</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">神经系统疾病内容总结。</span></li>
</ol>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><u>&nbsp;</u></span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><u>1</u><u>学时实验</u></span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">【<strong>教学目标</strong>】</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">理解并辨识中枢神经系统传染病的病理形态特点、临床病理联系及并发症。</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">【<strong>教学内容</strong>】</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">重点大体标本：流行性脑脊髓膜炎，乙型脑炎；重点切片：流行性脑脊髓膜炎，乙型脑炎。</span></p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><strong>第十一章 </strong><strong>结核病</strong><strong> </strong><strong>（</strong><strong>3</strong><strong>学时理论</strong><strong> + 1</strong><strong>学时实验）</strong></span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><strong><u>第</u></strong><strong><u>1</u></strong><strong><u>学时理论</u></strong></span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><strong>【教学目标】</strong></span></p>
<ol>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">理解并辨识结核病的基本病变及转化规律，熟悉结核病的病因及传播途径；</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">理解并辨识原发性肺结核（原发综合怔）病变特点、X线特征及转归；</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">理解并能识别结核病的发病机制。</span></li>
</ol>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><strong>【教学内容】</strong>1. 传染病流行病学概况；2. 结核病概述：病因、传播途径、发病机制；</span></p>
<ol start="3">
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">结核病的基本病变：渗出，增生，坏死；4. 结核病病变转归：愈合，恶化；</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">原发性肺结核病：Ghon complex，播散（血道，淋巴道，支气管）。</span></li>
</ol>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><strong><u>第</u></strong><strong><u>2</u></strong><strong><u>学时理论</u></strong></span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><strong>【教学目标】</strong><strong>理解并辨识</strong>继发性肺结核的发病机制、病变特点、各种类型病变、X线特征及转归。</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><strong>【教学内容】</strong>1. 局灶性肺结核；2. 浸润型肺结核；3. 慢性纤维空洞型肺结核：重要传染源；</span></p>
<ol start="4">
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">干酪性肺炎； 5. 结核球：结核瘤(tuberculoma) ；6. 粟粒性肺结核；</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">支气管内结核病；8. 结核性胸膜炎；9. 原发性肺结核与继发性肺结核的不同点。</span></li>
</ol>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><u>第</u><u>3</u><u>学时理论</u></span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">【<strong>教学目标</strong>】 熟悉肺外结核病的病变特点和转归。</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">【<strong>教学内容</strong>】</span></p>
<ol>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">肠结核：溃疡型，增生型； 2. 结核性腹膜炎：湿性，干性；</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">结核性脑膜炎：儿童多见，渗出为主，脑积水； 4. 泌尿、生殖系统结核；</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">骨、关节结核病：“冷脓肿”。</span></li>
</ol>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><u>1</u><u>学时实验</u></span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">【<strong>教学目标</strong>】1. 理解并辨识原发性肺结核与继发性肺结核的病变特点；</span></p>
<ol start="2">
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">熟悉常见肺外结核的病变特点及其类型。</span></li>
</ol>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">【<strong>教学内容</strong>】</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">重点大体标本：肺原发综合征，急性粟粒性肺结核，慢性纤维空洞性肺结核；</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">重点切片：淋巴结结核。</span></p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><strong>第十二章</strong><strong>&nbsp; </strong><strong>内分泌系统疾病</strong><strong> </strong>（2学时理论）</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">&nbsp;<u>第</u><u>1</u><u>学时理论</u></span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">【<strong>教学目标</strong>】1. 熟悉甲状腺功能亢进症的病因、发病机制和病理变化；</span></p>
<ol start="2">
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">理解单纯性甲状腺肿的病因和发病机理，熟悉其病理变化；</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">熟悉甲状腺肿瘤的病理组织学类型和形态学特征。</span></li>
</ol>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">【<strong>教学内容</strong>】1. 甲状腺功能亢进症：病因和发病机制，病理变化，转归；</span></p>
<ol start="2">
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">单纯性甲状腺肿：病因和发病机制，病理变化，转归；</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">甲状腺炎：桥本甲状腺炎，亚急性肉芽肿性甲状腺炎，</span></li>
</ol>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">亚急性淋巴细胞性甲状腺炎；</span></p>
<ol start="4">
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">甲状腺肿瘤：甲状腺腺瘤：病理特点；</span></li>
</ol>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">甲状腺腺癌：分型，病理变化，后果。</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><u>第</u><u>2</u><u>学时理论</u></span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">【<strong>教学目标</strong>】 熟悉糖尿病的类型、病理变化和临床病理联系。</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">【<strong>教学内容</strong>】</span></p>
<ol>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">糖尿病的病因和发病机制；</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">糖尿病的病理变化：胰岛，血管，肾脏，眼部，神经系统，其他器官病变；</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">糖尿病的临床病理联系。</span></li>
</ol>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><strong>第十三章</strong><strong>&nbsp; </strong><strong>免疫系统疾病</strong><strong> </strong>&nbsp;（2学时理论）</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><u>第</u><u>1</u><u>学时理论</u></span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">【<strong>教学目标</strong>】1. 理解并能识别免疫损伤的类型和机制；</span></p>
<ol start="2">
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">理解并能识别移植物排异反应的类型及病理变化。</span></li>
</ol>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">【<strong>教学内容</strong>】1. 免疫损伤的类型和机制：</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;I型－过敏型，II型－细胞毒型，III型－免疫复合物病，IV型－细胞介导型；</span></p>
<ol start="2">
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">肾移植排异反应：超急性，急性，慢性；细胞型，血管型。</span></li>
</ol>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><u>第</u><u>2</u><u>学时理论</u></span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">【<strong>教学目标</strong>】</span></p>
<ol>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">理解并辨识系统性红斑狼疮的病理变化，理解其病因、发病机制和临床病理联系；</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">理解并辨识艾滋病的病因、发病机制、传染途径、病理变化及临床病理联系。</span></li>
</ol>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">【<strong>教学内容</strong>】</span></p>
<ol>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">系统性红斑狼疮：病因，发病机制</span></li>
</ol>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">病理变化：主要脏器病变（肾脏，皮肤，心脏，关节，肺，肝，脾，淋巴结）；</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">临床病理联系；</span></p>
<ol start="2">
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">获得性免疫缺陷综合征（艾滋病）：病因及传播途径，发病机制，</span></li>
</ol>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">病理临床联系；淋巴样组织病变，机会性感染，继发恶性肿瘤。</span></p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><strong>第十四章</strong>&nbsp; <strong>淋巴造血系统疾病</strong><strong>&nbsp; </strong>（2学时理论）</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><u>第</u><u>1</u><u>学时理论</u><u> </u></span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><strong>【教学目标】</strong><strong> </strong>理解并能识别髓样组织常见肿瘤。</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><strong>【教学内容】</strong></span></p>
<ol>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">理解并能识别髓样组织常见肿瘤包括急性髓性白血病和慢性髓性白血病的发病机制、病理变化和转归；</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">理解并能识别急性淋巴母细胞性白血病/淋巴瘤的发病机制、病理变化和转归。</span></li>
</ol>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;"><u>第</u><u>2</u><u>学时理论</u></span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">【<strong>教学目标</strong>】 理解并辨识常见淋巴样组织肿瘤的病理特点和临床表现。</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">【<strong>教学内容</strong>】 淋巴样组织肿瘤：前B细胞和前T细胞肿瘤、周围B细胞肿瘤、霍奇金淋巴瘤和朗格汉斯组织细胞增生症。</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: SimSun;"><strong>内外讨论或练习、实践、体验等环节设计</strong><strong>：</strong></span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: SimSun;">病理学实践课程即是每周相应章节的实验课。实验课上每位同学都会有一盒（100张）教学切片和近150个大体标本的学习。实验课有绘图作业。</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: SimSun;">理论课有相应的测试题以便于同学们课后的复习和知识的梳理。</span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: SimSun;">助教负责讲授实验课的重点大体标本，并协助教师指导学生的重点切片观察、答疑、成绩记录与统计。</span></p></font></span><b style="mso-bidi-font-weight:normal"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋;mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;
font-size:10.5000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><o:p></o:p></span></b></p>
                </td>
            </tr>
